&lt;div class=&quot;styles-module__fieldItemName___s-uMO&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tech infrastructure and process design:&lt;/strong&gt; You ensure a high-performance analytics infrastructure to manage our rapidly growing travel volume (GMV) reliably, efficiently and at scale. A large part of your work will focus on making existing workflows more efficient and acting as a driver for lasting change: designing and steering projects for continuous process improvement and targeted (AI) automation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Financial steering &amp;amp; impact: &lt;/strong&gt;You take charge of steering and analyzing our entire GMV. Rather than just reporting, you analyze the numbers and derive concrete recommendations for action. To do this, you master our liquidity and risk KPIs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
