&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;You have at least &lt;strong&gt;five years of experience &lt;/strong&gt;in an &lt;strong&gt;analytical, process-driven field under your belt, ideally in finance.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
